Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.48,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Rikuto! Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.90,0:00:29.40,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,You can see it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.48,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,The island your dad used to live on!{The island your papa lived on!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.73,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.48,0:00:52.15,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,First time this far out \N in the sticks, huh?{First time being this far into the countryside, right?}{Doesn't show much this early, but talks like teenage girl when with Rikuto}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.15,0:00:54.81,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,But forget all that, \N look how big you’ve gotten!{Or rather, you sure have grown!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.81,0:00:56.94,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,I grew five centimeters last year!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.44,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Attaboy!{That's great!}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.15,0:01:00.90,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.02,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Rikuto-chan, you go play your heart out \N in the outdoors!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.02,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Leafia, can I leave Rikuto \N in your care?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.23,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Rikuto! You said you wanted \N to see a Koratta, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.23,0:01:15.15,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh? There’s a Koratta here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.15,0:01:18.35,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,The Pokemon ‘round here \N all get along real well with us folks{with people},
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.48,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,so you might just \N make some new friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.15,0:01:22.27,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Thanks for the treat!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.02,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Leafia! C’mon, quick!{Quickly, quickly!}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.02,0:01:27.02,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Be back for dinner, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.31,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,I’m heading out!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.56,0:01:37.48,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Now, then. We oughta get the feast ready. \N Let’s hop to it, yeah?{How about we also prepare the feast, SHALL WE?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.77,0:01:43.15,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Uh... Let’s hop to it, yeah.{Shall we... [without energy]}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.48,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Where could it be?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.15,0:01:51.15,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Where’s the Koratta?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.23,0:01:58.48,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.48,0:01:59.98,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.15,0:02:05.73,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ow... Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.73,0:02:06.40,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?{is this just a laugh?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.06,0:02:20.56,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,It’s a Kameil! \N I’ve never seen one before!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.65,0:02:31.35,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,You two know each other?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.35,0:02:32.15,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.02,0:02:38.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,This Kameil... Isn’t its tail a sorta \N different color{iro ga chigau, same words as irochigai/shiny but in a sentence} from what’s in the Index?{intentional "its"}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.23,0:02:40.31,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,There’s moss growing on its shell, too...{intentional "its"}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.35,0:02:47.06,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh! When a Kameil lives \N for a long time, its tail changes color!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.90,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn’t really think \N before grabbing—{'Sorry, suddenly attempting to touch--' [your tail was my bad, or something]}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.94,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.31,0:03:10.94,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.81,0:03:19.19,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,How far are you gonna go?!{How far are you going?}
Comment: 10,0:03:42.73,0:03:45.73,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ooh...
Comment: 10,0:03:46.19,0:03:47.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.98,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.98,0:03:50.48,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Wait...{'tte': "or wait", (what's going on) rather than 'matte!' "Wait, you!"}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.98,0:03:54.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Just hol—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Uh... Wh... What?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.65,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Is this a slide?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.65,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,“Come on down!”?{Come over here, you say?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.65,0:04:16.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Eugh, no way, no way, no way!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.19,0:04:29.10,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.23,0:04:32.23,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.60,0:05:10.35,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Leafia, will you go with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.77,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Here we go. Ready, and...!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.81,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,That’s payback for earlier!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.19,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Rikuto!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.44,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.19,0:06:07.69,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,How far did he go, playing around?{How far did he go to play?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.40,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.94,0:06:12.10,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Rikuto!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.19,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ah! Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.15,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,How did you get \N all the way down there...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.19,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.56,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.02,0:06:33.77,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Dad, you come down here too!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.48,0:06:39.02,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,No, no, no, \N I couldn’t slide down this at my age...{Sasuga. line}
Comment: 10,0:06:40.15,0:06:40.81,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.65,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,That’s cold!{unsure, think it's 'tsumeta--!'}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.56,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.90,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Huh? Kameil?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.31,0:06:52.65,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Just hol— {\i1}Waaaah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.48,0:07:04.81,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,So you... really are \N the Kameil from back th—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.02,0:07:10.98,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Yay! He got Dad, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.44,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ahh! Kameil, don’t run away!{I hear 'kameeru, nigeru na' but ZH disagrees lol. The JP 'Ahh!' doesn't match ZH 'how impressive' though so might be a real ZH change}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.31,0:07:15.90,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,You’re in for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.27,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.56,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.85,0:07:26.69,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,...leaving me out of the fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.48,0:07:31.02,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Let me join in!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.44,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Ahh... I’m exhausted...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.44,0:07:54.06,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Heh, what a joke...{That's just shameful/pathetic.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.44,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Rikuto-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.44,0:07:55.94,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.94,0:07:58.94,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Give this to Kameil.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.94,0:08:00.27,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,To Kameil?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.94,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,It’s {\i1}adooored{\i0}{super-loved} them since forever!{It's SUPER-liked them since old times!}{chou-suki is unusual/super-casual, apparently teenage girl vocab}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.48,0:08:04.19,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.98,0:08:16.90,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,You’re friends with Kameil too, \N Grandma{eh. obaachan}?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.98,0:08:21.06,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,There was a {\i1}biiig{\i0}{ok-kii} tunnel \N in the forest, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.48,0:08:26.06,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,That’s a shortcut I made \N {\i1}waaay{\i0} back{muka-shi} with Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.06,0:08:29.81,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,I went through that! \N Then, what about that slide?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.60,0:08:32.19,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,He made that with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.19,0:08:33.48,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.48,0:08:34.31,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.27,0:08:40.40,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,I think it was... \N somewhere around here...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.98,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Ahh, here! Here it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.56,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,What is it?{What, what?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.56,0:08:48.56,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,I buried this thirty years ago \N with Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.44,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,This really takes me back!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.69,0:09:01.48,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Ooh! This is you \N when you were young?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.27,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,And this Eevee...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.27,0:09:05.65,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Leafia, when he was young.{male Eevee tail pattern}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.81,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.73,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,But you haven’t changed at all, Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.69,0:09:16.77,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Well, they do say Kameil live for \N ‘round ten thousand years!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.94,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,So you’re a really old geezer?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.94,0:09:23.65,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Or maybe he’s still just a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.10,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Well, it makes no difference \N how old he is!{Well, whatever his age is is fine!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.48,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,When we all play together,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.48,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,we can always \N go back to this summer.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.98,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,You there! A battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.19,0:09:45.65,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,What a weird face!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.81,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,I came back for more fun!{I came to visit/play again!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.81,0:09:49.60,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,It’s finished!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.56,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Kameil, look, look! A rainbow!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.56,0:09:53.02,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Hold up, Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.02,0:09:55.19,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Kameil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.27,0:10:00.06,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kameil!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.65,0:10:16.56,Main,Shuri,0,0,0,,Now, then... \N Should we start heading back?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.27,0:10:19.35,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Your mom says she’s almost here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.35,0:10:22.27,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Really? Then Kameil, \N you can join us at—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.90,0:10:23.77,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.65,0:10:25.90,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Kameil?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.94,0:10:30.10,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Kameil, where’d you go?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.77,0:10:34.94,Main,Gaku,0,0,0,,Oh, right... Even back then, he had a habit of \N disappearing before you knew it...{That reminds me, even in old times, he would be gone by the time you realized, wouldn't he...}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.85,0:10:39.94,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,Will I ever see him again?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.94,0:10:53.15,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,I’ll make sure! \N I’ll come back next year!{Again next year too, I'll be sure to come here!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.15,0:10:58.10,Main,Rikuto,0,0,0,,So when I do... \N Let’s play together again, Kameil!
